Package: cpzeroos-no-initramfs
Version: 1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: CPZeroOS <15324879+therezor@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Provides: linux-initramfs-tool
Conflicts: initramfs-tools, dracut, tiny-initramfs
Description: boot without an initramfs
 The CardputerZero kernel has ext4 and the SD card driver built in, and the
 root filesystem is found by PARTUUID. This package stands in for an
 initramfs generator so the kernel package installs without one.
